<title>USA: Unisys division wins government contract.</title>
<headline>Unisys division wins government contract.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Wednesday one of its division had won a $37-million contract from the U.S. Department of Agriculture to provide computer software development, maintenance and data center management to its headquarters and field offices.</p>
<p>The company said the five-year contract that its Federal Systems Division had won from the Farm Service Agency would serve all of the department's agencies.</p>
<p>It said its division already provided similar services to the department.</p>
